&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;PHENOGY AG is a leading innovator of battery energy storage technologies and solutions for the green electrification of the planet. Our team members work on future-proof and sustainable battery systems that are powerful, safe, and robust – with circularity as a central principle. Our technology partner network spans leading battery research institutes. PHENOGY is an environmentally and socially conscious enterprise. We are committed to fostering prosperity for the people and our planet, ensuring sustainable growth – starting in the area of our greatest expertise and impact: energy storage solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We energize the future.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;PHENOGY is seeking curious, entrepreneurial-minded energy pioneers to help shape our vision, systems, and growth; playing a key-role as we launch into our ambitious future. If you’re inspired by our mission, values, and drive to change how we energize the future — we’d love your application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Purpose/Mission - The role owns the infrastructure, network and cybersecurity workstream for&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PHENOGY&#39;s corporate IT infrastructure (cloud, network, endpoints, identities and access) and its interfaces with the Battery Energy Storage System (BESS) product environment. It translates business, product, operational, customer and regulatory requirements into secure, resilient and auditable infrastructure and security controls across the BESS lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cybersecurity governance and the Information Security Management System (ISO/IEC 27001)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security architecture of BESS connectivity (EMS, BMS, gateways, IoT, APIs) and secure data exchange with partners such as Heidelberg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backup, business continuity and disaster recovery for critical systems (BESS/EMS, ERP, CRM)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management of infrastructure and cybersecurity projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your Tasks &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as internal-facing and technical owner of the IT infrastructure and security landscape: network, firewalling and web filtering, Microsoft 365/Azure tenants, identity and access management, endpoints, backup, and secure remote/supplier access to BESS sites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the asset and configuration inventory, network and security architecture documentation, risk register, vulnerability backlog, security policies and the infrastructure/security roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the risk management and vulnerability management cycle: periodic assessments, prioritisation, patching and remediation tracking across IT systems, applications, APIs and BESS connectivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and operate security monitoring, incident response, escalation paths, maintenance windows and problem management, together with external service providers (MSP/MSSP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define backup and retention policies (daily, monthly, yearly; 10+ years for critical data), offline/immutable backups, disaster-recovery runbooks and regular restore and DR tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define secure segmentation between corporate IT and the OT/BESS environment and secure remote access for O&amp;amp;M and field service, aligned with IEC 62443 concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide infrastructure, system-integration and cybersecurity support to the After Sales &amp;amp; Service framework once operational responsibility moves to the Service Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support B2B customer and audit requests: security questionnaires, tender requirements and compliance evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on when required: configure firewall rules, endpoint and identity policies, backup jobs and cloud security settings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key Projects (2027 portfolio)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risk Management &amp;amp; Vulnerability Assessment (Jan–Feb 2027): assess risks and vulnerabilities across all systems and deliver a prioritised remediation plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BESS Security Architecture II (Jan–Mar 2027): secure the BESS architecture and data exchange with Heidelberg, building on the current BESS security baseline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business Continuity &amp;amp; Recovery System (Feb–Apr 2027): offline backup and disaster recovery for critical systems such as BESS/EMS, ERP and CRM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Network Improvements (Feb–Jun 2027): introduce firewalling and web filtering, which are not yet in place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Threat Protection – ISO 27001 (Mar–May 2027): protect network and application traffic, including APIs and IP-based access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ISO 27001 Enhancements (ongoing): close control gaps, maintain policies and evidence, and prepare for audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take over operation of granular backup and advanced endpoint management, and provide security input to the PHENOGY IoT solution POC (BMS/EMS communication and REST APIs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Core Competencies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead assigned infrastructure and cybersecurity projects from initiation through closure, using structured scope, schedule, budget, dependency, risk, issue, decision and change control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create project charters, work breakdown structures, delivery plans, security requirements, test and DR-test plans, cutover plans, acceptance records and handover packages to operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate external suppliers (MSP/MSSP, network and firewall vendors, cloud providers, BESS/EMS partners) to resolve cross-functional blockers and escalate material decisions to the Head of IT and relevant governance bodies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide concise status reporting on progress, milestones, risk posture, vulnerabilities, incidents, suppliers and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required Qualifications &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree or equivalent professional experience in information technology, computer science, information security, engineering or a related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in IT infrastructure and cybersecurity management, including responsibility for delivering projects, ideally in an international mid-sized company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with network security (firewalls, VPN, segmentation, web filtering, IDS/IPS), Microsoft 365 / Entra ID / Intune / Defender, and backup and disaster recovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running risk assessments, vulnerability management and security incident response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience implementing or maintaining an ISMS according to ISO/IEC 27001.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating technical suppliers and multidisciplinary stakeholders across business, IT and engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand operational technology and industrial-system boundaries without assuming ownership of safety engineering or embedded-control design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong documentation, risk management and executive-status reporting skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional English; German or another relevant operating language is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strongly preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience securing Battery Energy Storage Systems, EMS, BMS, SCADA, PLC, PCS/inverters, industrial gateways, IoT or energy-data platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of IEC 62443, NIS2 and the EU Cyber Resilience Act in mixed IT/OT environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Azure networking and security, Microsoft Sentinel / Defender XDR and enterprise firewall platforms (e.g. Fortinet, Palo Alto, Check Point).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with industrial protocols and secure integration patterns, including Modbus TCP, OPC UA, MQTT, REST APIs, API gateways and certificate/PKI management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with backup and DR solutions for cloud and hybrid environments, including immutable and offline backups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognized credentials such as CISSP, CISM, ISO 27001 Lead Implementer/Auditor, GICSP, PMP, PRINCE2 or ITIL are advantageous&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decision-making authority: Approves infrastructure and security changes, firewall and access rules and security exceptions within the agreed policy framework and budget; may isolate systems or accounts during a security incident; escalates risk acceptance and major investments to the Head of IT.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting Line: Reporting to Head of IT Direct reports: none (functional lead of external infrastructure and security providers)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Workload: 100% - Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travel: approx. 10% – PHENOGY offices, BESS customer sites and partner/supplier sites as required&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Join a high-caliber environment that enables you to develop your full potential, shape your job, and take ownership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Participate in the development of PHENOGY and inspire the world to transition to sustainable energy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Become part of our eco-passionate expert team - a first-class team all around.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Benefit from flexible work hours as well as remote and on-site working in a modern sustainable office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Enjoy various events, an amazing coffee machine, and the occasional coffee from our CEO (acting Barista)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;At PHENOGY, we highly value diversity, equality, and inclusion. It makes our company stronger. &lt;strong&gt;Our philosophy: one mindset, many minds.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;For recruitment and staffing agencies: PHENOGY works exclusively with selected recruitment partners under formal agreements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;We do not accept unsolicited candidate submissions from agencies and assume no liability for claims made by unauthorized recruiters regarding our recruitment processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Director, Global Operations Excellence&lt;/strong&gt; will be responsible for leading Operational Excellence, standardisation, transformation, and continuous improvement across the Sony Interactive Entertainment global supply chain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working in a fast-paced, highly collaborative environment, this senior leader will oversee a team of Lean experts and Operational Excellence business standardisation specialists, ensuring SIE Operations continues to improve service quality, reduce waste, increase efficiency, and deliver consistent, high-performing operational practices across all regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting into Global Operations, this role will act as a key transformation leader across the Operations division, partnering with Logistics, Warehousing, Planning, Transportation, Finance, Procurement, Commercial, D2C, Customer Service, and regional Operations teams to drive measurable improvements across cost, service, process maturity, and customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the global Operations Excellence agenda for SIE, defining and executing a transformation roadmap focused on standardisation, Lean capability, service partner development, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the Operations Lean Kaizen Office, driving Lean transformation activities across operational functions, including Kaizen events, value stream mapping, Gemba practices, waste reduction, cost improvement, and operational performance improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of global operational standards, ensuring SIE delivers a consistent, high-quality service experience to customers, retailers, commercial partners, and internal stakeholders across all markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the central point for translating commercial, customer, and business requirements into operational solutions, ensuring requests are clearly assessed, prioritized, and converted into realistic delivery plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead global service partner development, including strategic tender activity, performance improvement, and commercial governance across warehousing 3PLs, control tower 4PLs, transportation partners, and other key Operations service providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee centralised budgetary analysis across Operations, supporting visibility, control, and governance of OPEX and CAPEX activities across the global supply chain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate data-driven insights into operational performance, ways of working, service quality, cost drivers, and customer impact, using these insights to shape strategic and continuous improvement initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key areas of focus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Service Partner Development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead global Operations tender activity across key warehousing 3PL, control tower 4PL, transportation, and logistics service partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Procurement, Finance, Legal, and regional Operations teams to ensure tender processes are commercially robust and operationally aligned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support service partner strategy, performance management, governance, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide budgetary oversight and centralised analysis of OPEX and CAPEX spend across Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve partner performance, cost efficiency, service delivery, and operational scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lean Transformation: Operations Lean Kaizen Office&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the Operations Lean Kaizen Office as the centre of excellence for Lean transformation across SIE Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Lean continuous improvement activities across all operational areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support weekly and monthly S&amp;amp;OE practices, ensuring continuous improvement is embedded into operational routines and decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and support Kaizen events, value stream mapping, Gemba walks, process diagnostics, and waste reduction initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver measurable improvements in efficiency, cost, service quality, process flow, and operational performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Lean capability across teams through coaching, standards, tools, and practical application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Distribution Excellence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee global operational standardisation across distribution, warehousing, transportation, and fulfilment practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure SIE delivers one consistent, high level of operational service excellence to its global customer base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop data-driven insights into how operational practices impact customers, commercial outcomes, cost, and service performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the central funnel point for commercial and customer requests, translating business needs into operational realities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify global best practices and scale them across regions, partners, and operational functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish performance metrics, governance forums, and improvement roadmaps to drive accountability and progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years’ experience in Operations, Supply Chain, Logistics, Operational Excellence, Lean Transformation, or a related global leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading Operational Excellence, Lean, continuous improvement, or business transformation programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of global supply chain operations, including warehousing, transportation, distribution, 3PL/4PL management, and operational governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading or supporting global tenders, service partner development, and supplier performance improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial acumen, with experience overseeing or analyzing OPEX, CAPEX, cost performance, and budgetary controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience with Lean tools and methodologies, including Kaizen, value stream mapping, Gemba, standard work, waste reduction, and continuous improvement routines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to translate commercial and customer requirements into operational plans and scalable processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent leadership skills, with experience managing high-performing teams of specialists or transformation experts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical capability, with the ability to turn operational data into strategic insight and measurable improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management skills across Operations, Finance, Procurement, Commercial, Customer Service, and regional leadership teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our Candidate Privacy Notice (where applicable) for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please note: this position is only available for students who are proficient in the Dutch language!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bij WPP Media zijn we het wereldwijde mediacollectief van WPP, volledig gebouwd voor het AI-tijdperk. We bundelen het beste platform, de meest getalenteerde mensen en de sterkste partners om innovatieve oplossingen te creëren. Ons doel? Merken elke dag ongeëvenaarde groei bieden. Dit fundament vinden we in onze gedeelde kernwaarden:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re Extraordinary:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We verleggen grenzen, dagen het gewone denken uit en doorbreken de status-quo in ons streven naar innovatie en groei.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re Open:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We bouwen vertrouwen en begrip door naadloos samen te werken – met onze teams, klanten en partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re Optimistic:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Een &#39;growth mindset&#39; zit in ons DNA. We omarmen verandering als dé manier om het beste uit onszelf te halen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Klaar om de social media-wereld te veroveren? Word onze Stagiair Social Media bij StudioM!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Droom jij ervan om te werken voor A-merken als Mentos, Katja en Tempo-Team? Krijg jij energie van het creëren van viral content en het spotten van de nieuwste TikTok-trends? Dan hebben we de perfecte match! Bij StudioM, het creatieve hart van WPP Media, zoeken we een gedreven Stagiair Social Media die ons team komt versterken.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wie zijn wij?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;StudioM is een uniek collectief van creatievelingen die verslaafd zijn aan digital design, contentcreatie en influencer marketing. We zijn onderdeel van WPP Media en werken vanuit die basis voor de gaafste merken. Je komt terecht in ons jonge, dynamische en supergezellige social media team. Verwacht flexibele kantoordagen, legendarische teamuitjes en een sfeer waar jouw input écht telt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jouw missie, mocht je die accepteren:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Stagiair Social Media ben jij de motor achter de online aanwezigheid van onze klanten. Je mond dichthouden? Geen optie! We willen jouw frisse ideeën.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content is King (or Queen):&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Je werkt mee aan ijzersterke contentkalenders en strategieën.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trendspotting:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Jij bent onze ogen en oren online. Je weet wat er speelt in de community, welke trends booming zijn en hoe we daarop kunnen inspelen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Community Love:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Je helpt mee met het managen van de social communities en bent de stem van het merk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create &amp;amp; Activate:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Je brainstormt mee over de vetste activaties en campagnes die engagement door het dak laten gaan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Je duikt in de data om insights te vinden die onze strategieën nóg slimmer maken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dit ben jij (toch?):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Jij bent allesbehalve een muurbloempje. Social media is jouw natuurlijke habitat en je schermtijd bewijst dat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je ademt social media, kent alle ins en outs van TikTok en Instagram en wordt wild van het creëren van nieuwe content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je hebt een proactieve, ‘hands-on’ mentaliteit. Een nieuwe update of trend? Jij ziet kansen en wilt meteen aan de slag.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent creatief, zelfstandig en leergierig (HBO-denkniveau).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;De Nederlandse taal heeft voor jou geen geheimen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je staat te popelen om te leren en jezelf te ontwikkelen in een high-paced omgeving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat bieden wij? De beste start van je carrière!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Een uitdagende stage&lt;/strong&gt; voor minimaal 5 maanden (4-5 dagen per week), startend in &lt;strong&gt;januari/februari 2027&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(startdatum in overleg).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stagevergoeding:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Een mooie vergoeding van €450 bruto per maand (op basis van fulltime).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibiliteit:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;De mogelijkheid om deels thuis te werken en je uren flexibel in te delen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Toplocatie:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Werken in een inspirerende omgeving in Amsterdam met bijna 120 leuke collega&#39;s, inclusief voordelige lunch en een barista voor je dagelijkse cafeïneshot.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fantastische merken&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;om je portfolio een enorme boost te geven.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Let op: een vereiste voor deze stage is dat je gedurende de gehele periode ingeschreven staat bij een onderwijsinstelling.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
